.TH KSTAR-EXPLAIN 1 "" "Kleene Star" "Kleene Star Manual"
.SH NAME
kstar\-explain \- explain an error code, such as E0200
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBkstar explain\fR <code>
\fBkstar explain\fR \-\-list
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Explains an error or warning code, such as E0200 or W0100, with an example.
Every error message shows its code in brackets: NameError[E0200].
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-list\fR
list every code with its title
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBkstar explain E0200\fR
explain one code
.TP
\fBkstar explain \-\-list\fR
list them all
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBkstar\fR(1),
\fBkstar\-help\fR(1)
.PP
The reference and the tutorial: https://github.com/Pratham71/kleene\-star
